# Deployed Contract Addresses (Arbitrum Sepolia)
# SinglePropertyToken: 0x0c566A1eb7d47861B176e39e05109b85e6385CD2
# USDC Token: 0x75faf114eafb1BDbe2F0316DF893fd58CE46AA4d

# Optional: Platform wallet address to grant MANAGER_ROLE
